# Domain rules

- No `UnityEngine` references in Domain.
- Board coordinates: garden x,z in [-9, 9]; legal points are Manhattan distance ≤ 12 from center; encode with stride 20 via `BoardCoords.ToCoordinate`.
- Movement APIs take an occupancy predicate (`Func<int, bool>` or board snapshot) — never `BoardManager.Instance`.
- Every behavior change in Domain must update or add a test under `tests/PaiSho.Rules.Tests`.
- Keep piece movement tables data-driven where practical; avoid duplicating direction arrays across files.
